<attribute name="mainDescription" nodeId="51e0b687">&lt;p style=&quot;MARGIN-RIGHT: 0px&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;
    Typical workshop discussion is focused around the following:
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        &lt;div style=&quot;MARGIN-RIGHT: 0px&quot;&gt;
            Reviewing functionality that the integrated architecture has to support
        &lt;/div&gt;
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        &lt;div style=&quot;MARGIN-RIGHT: 0px&quot;&gt;
            Identify all primary, alternate and exception paths
        &lt;/div&gt;
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        &lt;div style=&quot;MARGIN-RIGHT: 0px&quot;&gt;
            Identify all system interfaces and types, including interface complexity and dependencies
        &lt;/div&gt;
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        &lt;div style=&quot;MARGIN-RIGHT: 0px&quot;&gt;
            Alternate technology options
        &lt;/div&gt;
    &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;</attribute>
